== Trivia ==
* The Boomerang is a recurring item in ''[[wikipedia:The Legend of Zelda|The Legend of Zelda]]'' series. The icon used is inspired by ''The Magic Boomerang'''s appearance in the first ''The Legend of Zelda'' game.
* {{dlc|a}} This item is used in {{chal|I RULE!}}.
* This item can be found as one of the Nintendo-themed {{r|Treasure Room}} items in the 6th of December's [[List of curated daily challenges|Daily Run]], which is an homage to the late CEO of Nintendo, Satoru Iwata.

